  "description": "For those seeking more than just the “Lightest-stiffest-most aerodynamic” road bike experience, Warroad is just the thing. The agile and full-featured carbon fiber frameset is designed with Class 5™ VRS for compliance and composure on the rough stuff. Warroad’s endurance road geometry is designed for sustained rides, with ample frame and fork mounts for your all-day ride provisions. Designed to accommodate both 700c and 650b wheels, Warroad riders can set up a second wheelset for changing terrain or preferences. Add Shimano’s Ultegra components, renowned for light and smooth shifting, and you’ve got an all-road bike that feels right in every way.",
